WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:30.850 --> 01:32.250
Congratulations!

01:32.450 --> 01:34.350
Another loitering?

01:34.460 --> 01:35.620
"Lottery."

01:35.820 --> 01:39.390
Holding a drawing in November
seems to be a really weird time.

01:39.760 --> 01:42.300
It's something the Suzunose
Chamber of Commerce would do.

01:42.300 --> 01:43.960
So what's the prize?

01:44.200 --> 01:49.400
3rd prize is a bike, 2nd prize is coupons
for a BBQ restaurant, and 1st prize is...

01:49.970 --> 01:51.200
A hot springs vacation?

01:51.510 --> 01:53.270
Again?

01:53.270 --> 01:54.170
I'll draw the lot!

01:55.440 --> 01:57.150
2nd prize, BBQ coupons!

01:57.150 --> 02:01.310
Come to me!

02:17.170 --> 02:18.870
Congratulations!

02:18.870 --> 02:20.070
- You got 1st place! A hot springs vacation!

02:20.070 --> 02:22.830
- But I wanted some BBQ...
- You got 1st place! A hot springs vacation!

02:23.140 --> 02:24.610
Hot springs again...

02:24.610 --> 02:25.900
Yes, it is...

02:26.470 --> 02:31.410
Our Fox Deity, Takes Another Trip

02:35.550 --> 02:37.880
How did this trip end up with just us going?

02:38.090 --> 02:42.320
I will reveal the answer to that
mystery using witness testimonies.

02:42.690 --> 02:45.730
I think I ran out of paid time
off for the rest of the year.

02:45.730 --> 02:47.760
I'm not going.

02:47.760 --> 02:50.390
I don't want to be caught
by something weird again...

02:51.500 --> 02:55.440
If Toru-sama is not going,
it would not be right for me to go.

02:56.200 --> 02:58.670
Witness testimonies?
What are you talking about?

02:58.940 --> 03:02.640
Hot spring inns are all about murder mysteries!

03:03.750 --> 03:09.150
Don't tell me you were watching
suspense show reruns at home.

03:09.280 --> 03:11.650
A wonderful deduction, Inspector Takagami!

03:11.850 --> 03:13.550
Who're you calling an inspector?

03:13.720 --> 03:16.990
But Inspector, you must have a specific motive.

03:17.330 --> 03:20.830
You paid no heed to being seen
as a high school couple on a trip...

03:20.830 --> 03:23.520
...by making me go in female form.

03:24.170 --> 03:28.430
Women get a bonus
welcoming drink and dessert.

03:28.600 --> 03:34.560
I don't care as long as I can skip some
housework, eat good food and relax.

03:35.810 --> 03:38.870
"The Hot Springs of Relaxation, White Birch Inn."

03:39.380 --> 03:43.020
"Our traditional inn will provide you
with the pinnacle of hospitality."

03:43.020 --> 03:43.690
Head Clerk, Yanagi
"Our traditional inn will provide you
with the pinnacle of hospitality."

03:43.690 --> 03:45.210
Head Clerk, Yanagi

03:49.760 --> 03:51.590
Right this way.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.920
Welcome!

03:55.330 --> 03:57.730
Oh, my! We have a young couple today!

03:57.730 --> 03:59.670
N-No, she's my little sister.

03:59.900 --> 04:00.030
Waiting Staff, Tomomi

04:00.030 --> 04:02.370
Waiting Staff, Tomomi
Oh? You don't look like siblings.

04:02.370 --> 04:02.800
Oh? You don't look like siblings.

04:03.140 --> 04:05.140
- The Takagami couple has arrived!

04:05.140 --> 04:06.970
- What a nosy waitress.
- The Takagami couple has arrived!

04:07.040 --> 04:08.410
Welcome.

04:09.080 --> 04:11.380
I am the proprietress of this inn.

04:11.580 --> 04:11.950
Proprietress, Aya

04:11.950 --> 04:13.450
Proprietress, Aya
Please enjoy your stay.

04:13.450 --> 04:14.150
Proprietress, Aya
A pretty proprietress who
looks down on her luck.

04:14.150 --> 04:15.650
A pretty proprietress who
looks down on her luck.

04:15.650 --> 04:17.950
Aren't there stalls with carnival games here?

04:18.620 --> 04:20.280
Well, we are in the boonies.

04:20.420 --> 04:21.290
What about aerial tramways?

04:21.290 --> 04:23.020
What about aerial tramways?
An old guy who thinks life's bitterness
made him more of a man and...

04:23.020 --> 04:23.590
An old guy who thinks life's bitterness
made him more of a man and...

04:23.590 --> 04:26.030
Couple having an Affair, Shiga
An old guy who thinks life's bitterness
made him more of a man and...

04:26.030 --> 04:26.230
An old guy who thinks life's bitterness
made him more of a man and...

04:26.230 --> 04:26.360
Couple having an Affair, Kinoshita
An old guy who thinks life's bitterness
made him more of a man and...

04:26.360 --> 04:28.800
Couple having an Affair, Kinoshita
A clingy woman with flashy clothes and a face
caked in makeup who's obviously not his wife.

04:28.800 --> 04:30.100
A clingy woman with flashy clothes and a face
caked in makeup who's obviously not his wife.

04:30.100 --> 04:31.800
They're definitely having an affair.

04:31.800 --> 04:34.140
It's just like the shows!

04:34.140 --> 04:35.360
Hey...

04:39.970 --> 04:41.910
I'm sorry about that.

04:41.910 --> 04:45.540
We have a writer staying in this room.

04:45.650 --> 04:47.450
I got it!

04:47.450 --> 04:48.920
Maybe the photo will show
its eyes or something!

04:48.920 --> 04:50.450
College Student, Arishima

04:50.450 --> 04:50.850
College Student, Arishima
They are college students who are
part of a local history research club.

04:50.850 --> 04:51.050
They are college students who are
part of a local history research club.

04:51.050 --> 04:53.020
College Student, Kishida
They are college students who are
part of a local history research club.

04:53.020 --> 04:53.820
College Student, Kurata
They are college students who are
part of a local history research club.

04:53.820 --> 04:55.150
College Student, Kurata

04:55.660 --> 04:58.990
A writer in a slump and
youngsters with a death wish!

04:59.730 --> 05:01.900
The characters are all here!

05:01.900 --> 05:02.360
Thoroughwort Room

05:02.360 --> 05:03.830
Thoroughwort Room
Right this way.

05:04.900 --> 05:06.330
Enjoy.

05:09.600 --> 05:12.470
This is the welcoming drink and dessert?

05:13.210 --> 05:17.010
"In the bedroom, you will find only the
finest seasonal floral arrangements."

05:17.450 --> 05:19.610
They're all artificial!

05:20.550 --> 05:25.040
"Open the window and you will find
a natural view filled with greenery."

05:25.650 --> 05:28.420
The mountain is too close and
I'm feeling suffocated because of it!

05:29.060 --> 05:32.720
"You can feel the winds from
all four seasons in your room..."

05:34.560 --> 05:36.550
I'm feeling a draft coming from every direction!

05:37.370 --> 05:41.700
"Come here to relax as if
you had just returned home."

05:41.870 --> 05:44.000
I'd rather be at home!

05:45.570 --> 05:48.040
Hey, mind if I eat your dumplings?

05:50.750 --> 05:55.220
Suspicious guests staying at
an inn far from civilization.

05:55.220 --> 05:57.550
Murderous intent arises through
the steam of the hot springs!

05:58.090 --> 06:02.620
If there's a local legend involving a curse,
it would be perfect.

06:02.620 --> 06:03.420
- That'd be way too convenient...

06:03.420 --> 06:04.720
- But we do have one.
- That'd be way too convenient...

06:04.960 --> 06:07.260
A cursed legend, that is.

06:07.260 --> 06:09.200
You were eavesdropping?!

06:09.800 --> 06:12.930
There is this place we call "Snake's Hole" nearby.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.090
"Snake's Hole?!"

06:14.200 --> 06:15.070
Yes!

06:15.070 --> 06:18.160
Excuse me, we didn't order any food yet.

06:18.470 --> 06:20.440
The cook is just a day helper here.

06:20.440 --> 06:22.930
We're located far away,
so he left after making everything.

06:23.080 --> 06:26.100
Go ahead and eat. You probably
have nothing better to do.

06:26.410 --> 06:29.820
This all looks like microwaved food!

06:30.250 --> 06:32.620
Now about that "Snake's Hole."

06:32.620 --> 06:36.390
Those students you saw earlier
were looking into it also.

06:36.820 --> 06:38.460
Do you want to know about it?

06:38.460 --> 06:39.590
Yes, I do!

06:39.990 --> 06:41.150
All right.

06:42.600 --> 06:48.040
Far from the normal path up the mountains
is a cave called the "Snake's Hole."

06:48.040 --> 06:50.370
The locals are all scared and never go near it.

06:50.610 --> 06:56.280
For some reason, that cave has lots of
round, white stones scattered everywhere.

06:56.280 --> 07:00.820
They look like snake eggs so people
began to call it "Snake's Hole."

07:00.820 --> 07:01.520
- Time to eat.

07:01.520 --> 07:02.920
- 100 years ago...
- Time to eat.

07:03.050 --> 07:05.320
There used to be a spinning mill around here...

07:05.320 --> 07:09.310
...and a girl with bobbed hair
called O-Yae used to work there.

07:09.690 --> 07:12.590
O-Yae was the caretaker of the president's baby.

07:12.690 --> 07:17.560
One day, she was told to gather some of those
white stones in exchange for some glass beads.

07:17.730 --> 07:21.190
She was afraid but moved on anyway.

07:25.140 --> 07:26.040
And then...

07:27.410 --> 07:30.470
Something cold touched the back of her neck...

07:30.980 --> 07:34.350
She swung her sickle frantically and ran outside!

07:37.820 --> 07:40.420
The sickle was covered in blood!

07:40.420 --> 07:45.090
And the head of the baby on her back was gone!

07:46.390 --> 07:49.730
Ever since then, O-Yae confined
herself in the Snake's Hole...

07:49.800 --> 07:52.630
...and kills anyone who
goes near it with her sickle!

07:52.770 --> 07:54.500
I think we've had enough!

07:54.840 --> 07:55.730
Oh, really.

07:55.970 --> 07:57.800
Well, enjoy your stay.

07:59.470 --> 08:02.930
Geez, now I lost my appetite.

08:03.180 --> 08:06.350
I just know some kind of murder will happen!

08:06.350 --> 08:08.580
Curse of O-Yae Murder Mystery!

08:09.350 --> 08:10.250
A blackout?

08:10.450 --> 08:14.510
The murder will occur in the darkness!
Wait for the ear-piercing, bloodcurdling scream!

08:16.720 --> 08:17.630
No way.

08:17.630 --> 08:19.290
It's turning out exactly the way I want!

08:20.860 --> 08:21.420
What happened?!

08:24.170 --> 08:28.160
I-I saw a woman outside the window!

08:29.900 --> 08:32.170
She was looking at us!

08:32.670 --> 08:35.540
A woman? We're on the second floor...

08:35.880 --> 08:38.850
A great observation, Inspector Takagami.

08:39.080 --> 08:42.520
That would mean the woman
was floating in midair!

08:43.750 --> 08:46.150
Maybe you mistook her for something else?

08:46.150 --> 08:47.620
She was really there!

08:47.620 --> 08:48.820
It was a woman with bobbed hair!

08:49.790 --> 08:50.850
Bobbed hair?

08:51.090 --> 08:52.120
It's the curse.

08:53.490 --> 08:56.520
That's right. This is the curse of O-Yae!

08:59.130 --> 09:02.300
You people vandalized Snake's Hole
in the name of research!

09:02.640 --> 09:04.810
No! All we did was take some pictures!

09:04.810 --> 09:07.340
All right. Let's take a look at the backyard.

09:07.340 --> 09:10.540
A detective must always
investigate the scene of the crime!

09:13.510 --> 09:18.010
Unless it was a ghost or the woman had a really
long neck, it's impossible to look into that room.

09:21.520 --> 09:24.150
What is this? I smell something sweet.

09:24.830 --> 09:26.850
Do you smell dumplings or something?

09:27.090 --> 09:29.660
No, it smells more like fruit...

09:29.660 --> 09:30.730
Ugh, it's cold!

09:30.730 --> 09:31.700
Let's go back inside.

09:31.900 --> 09:33.060
Sure, I guess.

09:33.500 --> 09:36.960
And when we return,
the second murder will be happening!

09:37.710 --> 09:40.300
The first one didn't happen yet...

09:41.040 --> 09:43.080
You people are the culprits!

09:43.080 --> 09:46.410
What happened? Did one of the
college student girls get killed?!

09:46.550 --> 09:48.550
We're still alive!

09:48.550 --> 09:53.050
Arishima's camera and wallet
were stolen from his room!

09:53.050 --> 09:54.020
That's it?

09:54.020 --> 09:55.490
What's with that attitude?!

09:55.490 --> 09:58.590
So did these two having an affair steal it?

09:58.590 --> 10:00.250
We're not having an affair...

10:00.430 --> 10:03.700
They tried to leave at this hour!

10:03.700 --> 10:05.000
That's just way too suspicious!

10:05.170 --> 10:07.600
I don't want to stay at this inn anymore!

10:07.600 --> 10:12.040
It's rundown, the food is terrible, and the
waitress won't mind her own damn business!

10:12.210 --> 10:14.040
I understand how you feel.

10:14.510 --> 10:16.030
What's wrong?

10:16.280 --> 10:18.750
Call the police!

10:18.880 --> 10:22.210
Did someone get stabbed over
arguing who's leaving who?!

10:22.350 --> 10:23.610
No!

10:24.220 --> 10:25.380
Oh, no!

10:25.450 --> 10:26.510
What's wrong?

10:26.690 --> 10:30.180
A landslide happened on the
roads and blocked off access!

10:30.520 --> 10:31.650
A landslide?!

10:31.730 --> 10:32.720
See?

10:34.000 --> 10:35.300
Can't you shut up?! I'm trying to write here!

10:35.300 --> 10:36.760
(Self-proclaimed) Author, Mushanokoji
Can't you shut up?! I'm trying to write here!

10:36.760 --> 10:37.360
(Self-proclaimed) Author, Mushanokoji

10:37.530 --> 10:44.100
That means no one can enter or leave!

10:45.140 --> 10:48.540
Don't worry. I'll solve this.

10:51.550 --> 10:53.480
I swear on my grandpa's name!

11:05.390 --> 11:08.790
I can feel the god of
suspense shows empowering me!

11:08.930 --> 11:09.920
Ku, come here.

11:10.530 --> 11:14.500
Can't you use some kind of
spell to clear out the landslide?

11:14.500 --> 11:16.060
I can...

11:17.200 --> 11:18.140
But I don't want to.

11:18.140 --> 11:18.570
What?!

11:18.740 --> 11:21.780
Do detectives use magic to overturn an alibi?

11:21.780 --> 11:24.370
Do we use curses to smoke out the murderer?

11:24.650 --> 11:30.610
Mysteries are always solved using your
own intelligence, insight and inspiration.

11:30.820 --> 11:34.310
Don't worry. I'll solve all the mysteries!

11:34.460 --> 11:35.620
How?!

11:35.620 --> 11:41.760
Wandering around and getting involved with
every little thing will eventually solve it!

11:41.830 --> 11:43.560
That's how it happens on TV.

11:43.560 --> 11:44.190
Hey!

11:44.270 --> 11:46.930
Would you please return to your rooms for now?

11:47.270 --> 11:49.900
There will be no end to
the argument as it stands.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.340
Let's go.

11:51.340 --> 11:53.670
I prize solitude!

11:54.480 --> 11:59.500
I want to ask you something.
Did you hear about the thing with the ghost?

12:00.410 --> 12:01.980
Y-Yes...

12:01.980 --> 12:06.040
There was a blackout right before that.
Do they both happen all the time?

12:06.320 --> 12:08.650
Yes, well...

12:09.090 --> 12:12.990
O-Yae of Snake's Hole used to live
around where the inn now stands.

12:12.990 --> 12:17.120
It's been rumored her ghost
is still wandering around.

12:17.570 --> 12:20.660
Oh? I didn't know there was that rumor.

12:21.170 --> 12:24.710
Satomi-san, would you please
make some tea for our guests?

12:24.710 --> 12:27.740
Never mind that. What should we
do about breakfast tomorrow?

12:27.740 --> 12:30.070
The cook already left, you know.

12:30.180 --> 12:33.110
You have ghosts come out,
but you can't even make breakfast?

12:34.250 --> 12:36.240
W-We'll try to do something.

12:36.350 --> 12:38.840
We're very sorry.

12:39.490 --> 12:40.780
Now if you'll excuse us.

12:41.720 --> 12:47.750
It's that fruity smell. Where did I smell it before?

12:47.960 --> 12:51.900
What kind of inn is this? It's actually haunted?!

12:51.900 --> 12:57.100
But it's odd how that gossipy waitress
didn't hear about the ghost rumors.

12:57.740 --> 13:00.500
Time to do some legwork with the others!

13:00.710 --> 13:03.070
What is it you wanted to ask me?

13:03.480 --> 13:06.110
What were you doing at the time of the incident?

13:06.110 --> 13:11.290
You're looking for my alibi?
I was here writing my novel.

13:11.290 --> 13:14.790
I don't see a single line written!

13:14.790 --> 13:16.620
That's none of your business!

13:16.620 --> 13:19.930
Come on, didn't you see or hear anything?

13:19.930 --> 13:24.460
Someone like you always makes important
testimonies on those kind of shows!

13:25.100 --> 13:27.300
Are you trying to corrupt me?!

13:27.300 --> 13:29.900
Are you trying to make me less of a human?!

13:29.900 --> 13:34.670
I've been staying here for a week
but I didn't see anything strange!

13:36.780 --> 13:38.380
This feels good!

13:38.380 --> 13:39.980
Yeah, it does!

13:39.980 --> 13:46.680
The self-proclaimed novelist Mushanokoji didn't
hear about the ghost even after a week here.

13:46.920 --> 13:50.960
Wow! And to think you're still in high school!

13:50.960 --> 13:53.260
Now I know why you came here
on a trip with your boyfriend!

13:53.390 --> 13:57.600
You're supposed to be siblings,
but the waitress said that's a lie!

13:57.600 --> 14:00.670
Well, your group has one man and two women.

14:00.670 --> 14:03.360
Won't there be problems
like with a love triangle?

14:03.770 --> 14:05.440
Never!

14:05.440 --> 14:08.080
He's a great guy,
but he has really bad taste in everything.

14:08.080 --> 14:11.270
His looks are below average and
he doesn't have any money either.

14:11.580 --> 14:14.740
Weren't the stolen wallet and camera expensive?

14:15.020 --> 14:16.210
Not at all!

14:17.550 --> 14:19.490
But you're really amazing!

14:19.490 --> 14:22.160
I wish I had your chest!

14:22.160 --> 14:23.360
Do you mind if I touch them?

14:23.360 --> 14:25.330
They don't even know those aren't real...

14:25.330 --> 14:28.960
So that's what they really thought of me!

14:30.700 --> 14:34.400
Whoa. This shampoo smells really pungent.

14:34.840 --> 14:41.040
Hey, do you think they'll like me better if I
prove this inn is haunted and make it famous?!

14:41.210 --> 14:43.780
Famous? Are you sure it can be?

14:43.780 --> 14:48.350
It's the in thing right now. Some people
travel to haunted places around the country.

14:48.350 --> 14:52.290
Besides, that Shiga person is a
writer for an occult magazine!

14:52.750 --> 14:53.720
You mean that old dude?

14:53.920 --> 14:58.590
I saw him in a magazine before.
Maybe he'll write an article on this place.

14:58.590 --> 14:59.720
What do you think?

15:01.560 --> 15:06.570
I came here to relax!
Why is everyone looking for trouble?!

15:06.570 --> 15:09.130
Wow, you seem to be relaxing.

15:10.070 --> 15:15.030
What's that extremely sweet yet
obviously cheap, fruity smell?

15:15.280 --> 15:17.580
I used the shampoo they keep at the inn.

15:17.580 --> 15:19.910
But no one else smelled like...

15:21.120 --> 15:22.780
No, there is!

15:23.520 --> 15:25.850
The head clerk had the same smell!

15:28.460 --> 15:30.660
That's probably because he refilled the shampoo.

15:30.660 --> 15:32.060
Oh, right.

15:32.260 --> 15:34.430
This is going nowhere!

15:34.430 --> 15:37.830
When is the third murder going to happen?!

15:37.970 --> 15:40.430
Let's just go to sleep.

15:40.430 --> 15:41.660
I'm going to brush my teeth.

15:45.610 --> 15:46.600
What's this?

15:54.250 --> 15:55.310
That's my wallet!

15:55.550 --> 15:57.640
Was it you?! Was it you who stole it?!

15:57.950 --> 15:58.820
No!

15:59.990 --> 16:02.990
They're stones from Snake's Hole.

16:02.990 --> 16:04.960
Those were stuffed in your wallet...

16:09.600 --> 16:10.560
What happened?!

16:10.760 --> 16:12.930
Hey! That's my camera!

16:13.530 --> 16:13.930
- Now what?!

16:13.930 --> 16:15.400
- I can't take this anymore!
- Now what?!

16:16.040 --> 16:17.130
Can't you all just shut up?!

16:17.200 --> 16:19.070
So you were the culprits.

16:19.070 --> 16:20.710
No!

16:20.710 --> 16:25.810
We found it by the Pampas Grass Room and
checked it because we thought it was yours!

16:25.810 --> 16:29.010
It's gone. All the pictures I took are gone.

16:35.220 --> 16:37.060
Ku! We got trouble!

16:37.060 --> 16:37.260
There's an incident going...

16:37.260 --> 16:38.830
Aren't you an occult writer?!
There's an incident going...

16:38.830 --> 16:39.420
Aren't you an occult writer?!

16:39.690 --> 16:39.860
It's too scary here! I want to go home!

16:39.860 --> 16:41.500
It's too scary here! I want to go home!
Ku, wake up!

