It's finally morning...

17:09.690 --> 17:12.450
I'm glad I made it to morning...

17:14.330 --> 17:15.190
Ku?

17:16.500 --> 17:17.690
Ku!

17:20.170 --> 17:21.340
Wait!

17:21.340 --> 17:21.900
Ku?

17:21.900 --> 17:22.730
Now what?!

17:23.170 --> 17:25.770
Catch him!

17:25.770 --> 17:27.370
Who's that guy?!

17:34.310 --> 17:37.110
You have nowhere to run!

17:38.190 --> 17:39.480
What happened?!

17:40.790 --> 17:42.420
Who is he?

17:42.690 --> 17:44.520
Minamoto-san?

17:44.790 --> 17:47.090
He's our cook!

17:47.290 --> 17:48.660
What did you do to Ku?

17:49.400 --> 17:51.760
I was just making breakfast...

17:52.700 --> 17:54.290
Gather everyone here.

17:56.770 --> 17:59.200
All the mysteries have now been solved!

18:01.140 --> 18:03.140
All the mysteries are solved?!

18:03.140 --> 18:04.740
What do you mean by that?

18:05.380 --> 18:07.640
This happened when I woke up in the morning.

18:10.150 --> 18:13.880
I smelled rice cooking from the first floor.

18:15.860 --> 18:18.830
And I saw this man cooking breakfast.

18:20.430 --> 18:22.300
Don't you think that's strange?

18:22.300 --> 18:25.530
The inn should have been
isolated because of the landslide.

18:25.970 --> 18:29.300
The cook is supposed to have gone home,
so what is he doing here?

18:30.870 --> 18:34.170
There can only be one reason!
There was no landslide!

18:35.810 --> 18:41.340
But you secretly called the cook because
no one else knew how to prepare food.

18:42.150 --> 18:42.770
Who did?!

18:43.220 --> 18:46.650
You were giving off a real fruity smell last night.

18:47.350 --> 18:50.810
And I picked up the same smell in the backyard.

18:53.130 --> 18:55.960
I guess foxes have really good senses of smell.

18:56.360 --> 19:00.090
When we went to the backyard,
Noboru hadn't taken a bath yet.

19:00.300 --> 19:04.500
That means you were the one in the backyard.

19:04.840 --> 19:07.400
What were you doing there?

19:08.080 --> 19:09.040
Head clerk!

19:09.680 --> 19:11.540
Th-That's because...

19:12.050 --> 19:15.410
You made the fake O-Yae appear in the backyard!

19:16.450 --> 19:18.010
Then that was!

19:24.260 --> 19:26.560
I-I'm so sorry...

19:33.600 --> 19:36.090
This is what you thought was O-Yae.

19:36.640 --> 19:38.260
Why did you do this?!

19:38.440 --> 19:41.130
Because he wanted to save this inn.

19:41.380 --> 19:46.280
He wanted to make this inn famous
by trying to make it seem haunted?

19:46.580 --> 19:50.020
I planned this after hearing an occult
magazine writer would be staying over...

19:50.020 --> 19:56.750
Yes. He even lied about the landslide
to make sure the writer didn't leave.

19:57.120 --> 20:02.290
Then the blackout, the stolen wallet,
the erased pictures on the camera were all...

20:02.600 --> 20:04.060
It was me...

20:04.260 --> 20:07.890
I couldn't bear to see this
inn decline even further.

20:08.370 --> 20:11.670
I did this all for the inn.

20:12.910 --> 20:14.810
There's the culprit's confession...

20:14.980 --> 20:18.000
But the real perpetrator is still on the loose!

20:18.650 --> 20:21.580
That's the iron law of suspense shows!

20:21.580 --> 20:25.210
The real perpetrator will be
ousted at the very last moment!

20:25.520 --> 20:28.390
And the real perpetrator is...

20:28.820 --> 20:29.790
You!

20:30.790 --> 20:34.800
You wanted to let the head clerk take
all the blame, but I won't let you!

20:34.800 --> 20:37.200
The proprietress isn't...

20:37.200 --> 20:38.630
It's all right.

20:38.900 --> 20:42.840
You're right. I planned all of this!

20:43.640 --> 20:49.080
The customers stopped coming when I took over,
and now the inn is about to be closed down.

20:49.510 --> 20:51.640
I'm so sorry!

20:52.710 --> 20:59.210
What she did was horrible, but some
sympathy is felt after hearing her motive.

21:00.090 --> 21:02.920
And now it's all solved!

21:03.490 --> 21:06.430
Oh, it was just a doll...

21:06.590 --> 21:09.500
It wasn't a ghost? That's no fun at all.

21:09.500 --> 21:11.930
I wish I didn't find out the truth.

21:13.730 --> 21:15.440
I can't write an article on this.

21:15.440 --> 21:16.990
That was stupid.

21:17.600 --> 21:21.130
If you asked me,
I could have made it much better!

21:21.680 --> 21:22.940
Why?!

21:22.940 --> 21:25.950
This is where a melancholic ending theme plays...

21:25.950 --> 21:31.410
...while the characters all look
on as they face the next day!

21:56.210 --> 22:01.480
Hare mo ke mo naku oowarawa de neboketerarenai
With all the commotion, I can't stay still.

22:01.980 --> 22:07.510
Kidoairaku gochamaze aa ijou
With emotions running wild,
everything seems so odd.

22:07.820 --> 22:13.320
Inochimijikashi toiunonara hara wo kukutte
Life is short so be prepared for anything.

22:13.630 --> 22:18.760
Iran kyoukai nanno sono yuke
Transcend that useless boundary and go!

22:18.830 --> 22:19.490
Kitsune Soba

22:19.800 --> 22:25.470
kingin kagayaku suteki na mainichi
With those bright days behind you,

22:25.610 --> 22:31.410
omatsurisawagi de mairouka
It's time for some merrymaking.

22:31.980 --> 22:37.810
Sora ni hi wo tomoshi tamashii no pareedo
Light the skies for this parade of souls,

22:37.950 --> 22:43.690
shiawase no kotodama hora kousa suru
The kotodama of happiness crosses paths.

22:43.820 --> 22:49.420
Namida mo wasurete odori odore
Forget those tears and dance away,

22:49.660 --> 22:55.570
toriaezu iiyone tanoshikeryasa
Forget about everything else
since we're having fun now.

